# 必考词 Unit 02 短语

## 常考短语

- **appeal to**: 呼吁；对…有吸引力 — The idea of early retirement appeals to many people. 提前退休的想法对很多人有吸引力。
- **apply for**: 申请 — She applied for a visa to study in the UK. 她申请了去英国留学的签证。
- **apply to**: 适用于；应用于 — This rule applies to everyone. 这条规则适用于所有人。
- **approve of**: 赞成，同意 — Her parents didn't approve of her marriage. 她的父母不赞成她的婚姻。
- **arise from**: 由…引起 — Many problems arise from poor communication. 许多问题是由沟通不畅引起的。
- **as a result of**: 由于…的结果 — As a result of the storm, many flights were cancelled. 由于暴风雨，许多航班被取消了。
- **assess...as**: 把…评定为 — The project was assessed as highly successful. 该项目被评定为非常成功。
- **assign...to**: 把…分配给 — The manager assigned the task to the new employee. 经理把任务分配给了新员工。
- **assimilate into**: 融入，同化 — It took years for him to assimilate into the local community. 他花了好几年才融入当地社区。
- **assist sb in doing sth**: 帮助某人做某事 — The software assists users in managing their finances. 该软件帮助用户管理财务。
- **attach importance to**: 重视 — The school attaches great importance to students' mental health. 学校非常重视学生的心理健康。
- **be appropriate for**: 适合于 — This movie is not appropriate for young children. 这部电影不适合幼儿观看。
- **alter one's attitude**: 改变态度 — Travel can help you alter your attitude toward life. 旅行可以帮助你改变对生活的态度。
- **anticipate doing sth**: 预期做某事 — We anticipate finishing the project by December. 我们预期在12月前完成项目。
- **be apparent to**: 对…来说是显而易见的 — The solution was apparent to everyone in the room. 解决方案对房间里的每个人来说都是显而易见的。
